WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
Understand each factor and its weight. Every value here is illustrative and needs workbook approval.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:11.080
Explore a desired-salary scenario. This example calculation is not an increment offer.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:16.600
Operations uses a different work model. Task mix and quality matter, not only the number of tasks.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:23.880
A closed month stays fixed. Later client remapping must not rewrite the historical review.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:30.480
The employee adds achievements, challenges and a development goal before submitting the review.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:35.720
The manager records the discussion before finalizing. No salary change is triggered.
